{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-1","case_title":"أبولو 1 | Apollo 204","evidence_index":1,"evidence_type":"official_finding","statement":"الاختبار لم يُصنّف خطرًا مسبقًا. اجتمع الأكسجين النقي المضغوط مع مواد قابلة للاحتراق وقصور في حماية الأسلاك وضبط الجودة.","source_ids":["A1-SEN","A1-H2"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A1-SEN","title":"Apollo 204 Accident — Senate Report No. 956","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/as204_senate_956.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/07-senate-final-report.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 3–5 (PDF pp. 8–10)"},{"source_id":"A1-H2","title":"Frank Borman's Testimony to the House — Part 2","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormanhouse2.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/03-house-2.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 114, 122–125"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/as204_senate_956.pdf","https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormanhouse2.pdf"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-1].evidence[0]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-1","case_title":"أبولو 1 | Apollo 204","evidence_index":2,"evidence_type":"probable_cause","statement":"المصدر الأرجح قوس كهربائي قرب أرضية حجرة المعدات اليسرى. لم يُحدد سلك أو عنصر بعينه بصورة قاطعة.","source_ids":["A1-SEN","A1-S1"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A1-SEN","title":"Apollo 204 Accident — Senate Report No. 956","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/as204_senate_956.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/07-senate-final-report.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 3–5 (PDF pp. 8–10)"},{"source_id":"A1-S1","title":"Frank Borman's Testimony to the Senate — Part 1","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormansenate1.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/04-senate-1.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 179–180"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/as204_senate_956.pdf","https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormansenate1.pdf"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-1].evidence[1]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-1","case_title":"أبولو 1 | Apollo 204","evidence_index":3,"evidence_type":"official_finding","statement":"ارتفع ضغط المقصورة وتعذّر فتح الباب الداخلي قبل التمزق. كان الاختناق بالغازات السامة السبب الأساسي للوفاة. وُثّقت الحروق عاملًا مساهمًا في إفادة اللجنة.","source_ids":["A1-SEN","A1-H1"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A1-SEN","title":"Apollo 204 Accident — Senate Report No. 956","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/as204_senate_956.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/07-senate-final-report.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 3–5 (PDF pp. 8–10)"},{"source_id":"A1-H1","title":"Frank Borman's Testimony to the House — Part 1","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormanhouse1.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/02-house-1.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 81–83"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/as204_senate_956.pdf","https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormanhouse1.pdf"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-1].evidence[2]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-1","case_title":"أبولو 1 | Apollo 204","evidence_index":4,"evidence_type":"source_discrepancy","statement":"زمن فتح الباب قرابة 4:55 من البلاغ في تقرير الشيوخ، مقابل 4:36 في إفادة مبكرة. لا يمثل أي منهما مدة بقاء الطاقم واعيًا.","source_ids":["A1-SEN","A1-S3","A1-NUM"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A1-SEN","title":"Apollo 204 Accident — Senate Report No. 956","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/as204_senate_956.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/07-senate-final-report.pdf","locator_text":"printed p. 5 and footnote 11"},{"source_id":"A1-S3","title":"Frank Borman's Testimony to the Senate — Part 3","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormansenate3.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/06-senate-3.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 245–246"},{"source_id":"A1-NUM","title":"Apollo by the Numbers: A Statistical Reference","url":"https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20010008244","local_file_reference":"../sources/01-apollo-by-the-numbers.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 4–8"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/as204_senate_956.pdf","https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormansenate3.pdf","https://ntrs.nasa.gov/citations/20010008244"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-1].evidence[3]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-1","case_title":"أبولو 1 | Apollo 204","evidence_index":5,"evidence_type":"witness_testimony","statement":"قال بورمان إنه كان يعتقد أن الاختبار آمن قبل الحادث، وكان سيرفضه بالمعلومات اللاحقة. رأيه بشأن النجاة بباب أسرع تقدير لسيناريو بديل.","source_ids":["A1-S2","A1-H1"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A1-S2","title":"Frank Borman's Testimony to the Senate — Part 2","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormansenate2.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/05-senate-2.pdf","locator_text":"printed p. 217"},{"source_id":"A1-H1","title":"Frank Borman's Testimony to the House — Part 1","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormanhouse1.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/02-house-1.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 84, 89–90"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormansenate2.pdf","https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormanhouse1.pdf"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-1].evidence[4]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-1","case_title":"أبولو 1 | Apollo 204","evidence_index":6,"evidence_type":"reported_allegation","statement":"نُسبت إلى هولمبورغ رواية عن محاولة خروج لخمس دقائق، لكنه نفاها. يضم مقتطف بارون ملاحظات عن الجودة وإقراره بعدم القدرة على إثبات كل ما ورد.","source_ids":["A1-BT","A1-BR"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A1-BT","title":"Thomas Baron testimony before Congress","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/history/Apollo204/baron.htm","local_file_reference":"../sources/09-baron-testimony.txt","locator_text":"printed pp. 483–501 as a whole; lines 251–263, 1889–1903"},{"source_id":"A1-BR","title":"Thomas Baron report excerpt","url":null,"local_file_reference":"../sources/10-baron-report-excerpt.md","locator_text":"introduction and General Notes"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.nasa.gov/history/Apollo204/baron.htm"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-1].evidence[5]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-1","case_title":"أبولو 1 | Apollo 204","evidence_index":7,"evidence_type":"official_finding","statement":"وثقت مراجعة فيليبس قصورًا في أداء المقاول والصنعة والجودة قبل الحريق. لا تثبت المراجعة بذاتها علاقة سببية مباشرة بالحريق.","source_ids":["A1-PH","A1-SEN"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A1-PH","title":"Phillips Report — NASA Apollo 1 archive","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/history/Apollo204/phillip1.html","local_file_reference":"../sources/08-phillips-report.md","locator_text":"section IV.H–I; original markers [16]–[17]"},{"source_id":"A1-SEN","title":"Apollo 204 Accident — Senate Report No. 956","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/as204_senate_956.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/07-senate-final-report.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 7, 11–16"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/as204_senate_956.pdf","https://www.nasa.gov/history/Apollo204/phillip1.html"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-1].evidence[6]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-1","case_title":"أبولو 1 | Apollo 204","evidence_index":8,"evidence_type":"historical_response","statement":"ضيّقت ناسا استخدام المواد القابلة للاحتراق، وطورت بابًا سريع الفتح، ورفعت جاهزية فرق الطوارئ وأنشأت رقابة مستقلة للسلامة.","source_ids":["A1-SEN"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A1-SEN","title":"Apollo 204 Accident — Senate Report No. 956","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/as204_senate_956.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/07-senate-final-report.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 6–7, 10–11"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/as204_senate_956.pdf"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-1].evidence[7]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-1","case_title":"أبولو 1 | Apollo 204","evidence_index":9,"evidence_type":"design_inference","statement":"باب سريع الفتح في ظروف الطوارئ مع مواد أقل قابلية للاحتراق قد يرفع فرصة الإخلاء. لا يمكن ضمان النجاة في هذا السيناريو.","source_ids":["A1-H1","A1-H2"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A1-H1","title":"Frank Borman's Testimony to the House — Part 1","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormanhouse1.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/02-house-1.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 83–84"},{"source_id":"A1-H2","title":"Frank Borman's Testimony to the House — Part 2","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormanhouse2.pdf","local_file_reference":"../sources/03-house-2.pdf","locator_text":"printed pp. 133–135"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormanhouse1.pdf","https://www.nasa.gov/wp-content/uploads/static/history/Apollo204/bormanhouse2.pdf"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-1].evidence[8]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-13","case_title":"أبولو 13 | Apollo 13","evidence_index":1,"evidence_type":"official_finding","statement":"استُخدم التسخين المطوّل عند تعذّر تفريغ الخزان بالطريقة العادية. لم تكن مفاتيح الحماية مؤهلة للفصل تحت حمل مصدر الطاقة الأرضي بجهد 65 فولت.","source_ids":["A13-H"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A13-H","title":"Apollo 13 Mission Review — Senate hearing","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746/pdf/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746.pdf","local_file_reference":null,"locator_text":"printed pp. 3–6; findings and determinations"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746/pdf/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746.pdf"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-13].evidence[0]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-13","case_title":"أبولو 13 | Apollo 13","evidence_index":2,"evidence_type":"probable_cause","statement":"رجّح التحقيق أن مفاتيح الحماية التحمت مغلقة أثناء التفريغ الأرضي، وأن التسخين المفرط أضر بعزل الأسلاك. كانت قراءة الحرارة خارج نطاق القياس، وقدّرت الاختبارات اللاحقة حرارة موضعية مرتفعة.","source_ids":["A13-H"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A13-H","title":"Apollo 13 Mission Review — Senate hearing","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746/pdf/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746.pdf","local_file_reference":null,"locator_text":"printed pp. 3–6; findings and determinations"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746/pdf/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746.pdf"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-13].evidence[1]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-13","case_title":"أبولو 13 | Apollo 13","evidence_index":3,"evidence_type":"official_finding","statement":"الاحتراق داخل الخزان رقم 2 أدى إلى فشله. أدى العطل إلى تسرّب من منظومة الخزان رقم 1 وفقد الطاقة من خلايا الوقود المعتمدة على الأكسجين.","source_ids":["A13-H"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A13-H","title":"Apollo 13 Mission Review — Senate hearing","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746/pdf/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746.pdf","local_file_reference":null,"locator_text":"printed pp. 3–6; findings and determinations"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746/pdf/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746.pdf"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-13].evidence[2]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-13","case_title":"أبولو 13 | Apollo 13","evidence_index":4,"evidence_type":"probable_cause","statement":"رجّح المحققون أن قوسًا في أسلاك محرك المروحة أشعل عزل التفلون عقب تشغيل المراوح. لا تحدد القياسات عن بعد موضع كل حدث أو ترتيبه الدقيق.","source_ids":["A13-H"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A13-H","title":"Apollo 13 Mission Review — Senate hearing","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746/pdf/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746.pdf","local_file_reference":null,"locator_text":"printed pp. 3–6; findings and determinations"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746/pdf/GPO-CHRG-91shrg4746.pdf"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-13].evidence[3]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
{"schema_version":"2.0.0","record_type":"safety_evidence_claim","source_category":"nasa_safety_case_study","case_id":"apollo-13","case_title":"أبولو 13 | Apollo 13","evidence_index":5,"evidence_type":"historical_response","statement":"عملت الوحدة القمرية أكواريوس كملجأ مستقل للأكسجين والطاقة والدفع. حُفظت بطاريات وحدة القيادة للعودة، واستُخدم محوّل لتشغيل مرشحات ثاني أكسيد الكربون فيها. عاد الطاقم في 17 أبريل.","source_ids":["A13-N","A13-P"],"sources":[{"source_id":"A13-N","title":"Apollo 13: The Successful Failure","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/missions/apollo/apollo-13-the-successful-failure/","local_file_reference":null,"locator_text":"rescue and return"},{"source_id":"A13-P","title":"Houston We Have a Podcast — Apollo 13","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/podcasts/houston-we-have-a-podcast/apollo-13/","local_file_reference":null,"locator_text":"opening mission summary and crew recollections"}],"citation_urls":["https://www.nasa.gov/missions/apollo/apollo-13-the-successful-failure/","https://www.nasa.gov/podcasts/houston-we-have-a-podcast/apollo-13/"],"source_file":"Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_relative_path":"data/raw/nasa-safety-cases/Safety_Dashboard_Data.json","source_sha256":"41d652a8990c4f13f53e6998bc3247a8984f29e40d49c266a2403fa5d0c217e1","source_location":"records[apollo-13].evidence[4]","record_status":"curated_claim_with_source_locators","model_fit_eligible":false}
